---

## 7) Anti-patterns (avoid)

- Adding dozens of page YAML files **only** as nested `Home/.../Long Name/Long Name.yml` without running **`serialization validate --fix`**.
- Using the **same** `Navigation` behaviour for Bupa and other verticals when Bupa needs a **completely different** DOM — use a **separate export** or component name.
- **Globally** changing shared navigation or header behaviour without a **feature flag**, context, or distinct component name.
- Registering the component in **`component-map.ts`** but forgetting **Available Renderings** or **placeholder settings**, so authors cannot add it.
